OL,3,GNEWSAVandals to help clean graffiti
OL,4,Aunder new scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FVandals who spray graffiti in
OL,7,FNottingham will be made to "clean up
OL,8,Fthe messes they have made" under a new
OL,9,Fcouncil scheme.
OL,11,FNottingham City Council is introducing
OL,12,Fa graffiti removal team, supported by
OL,13,Fthe county's police and crime
OL,14,Fcommissioner's (PCC) "immediate justice
OL,15,Fprogramme", which involves
OL,16,F"community-based reparative
OL,17,Factivities".
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
