OL,3,GNEWSAVandals to help clean graffiti
OL,4,Aunder new scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, the authority said the
OL,7,Fnew approach was designed to ensure
OL,8,F"those responsible for low-level
OL,9,Foffending make a positive contribution
OL,10,Fto the communities affected by
OL,11,Fanti-social behaviour".
OL,13,FGary Godden, PCC for Nottinghamshire,
OL,14,Fsaid the partnership with the council
OL,15,Fwas "a win-win" for residents.
